<BRK/>
<SPT><TTL><SUB>Switchgear Design and Production Tests</SUB></TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Furnish reports which include results of design and production tests performed according to <RID>IEEE C37.74</RID>.  Perform 
production tests by the manufacturer on each switchgear assembly to ensure that design performance is maintained 
in production.</TXT><BRK/>
